          "text": "Itu nyu asis ato, nyinö köteyilo kegh pich mwagh nyo anyïn, kworöritu chane, nyinö kötöroto kegh mu angwoy kïrata kegh pörköy, nyinö köteghöy putekwa kïpïchighitu, kïlïkwï palurtin, akïnyinö köteloköy sïro pö katani, kulak sarankwachtin. Wöghöko pïchighyengwa kïlïku arasï!",
